@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #4A6FA5
title Debounce: one observation of the selected root (simplified)
start
:Every reachable root updates its own\nhigh-water epoch/ID on the committed scan;
if (Selected root changed, or\nfresh epoch change?) then (yes)
  :Reset stable and candidate continuity;
endif
if (Result is a fault?) then (yes)
  :Keep exact reason and origin;\nreset stable and candidate to `initial`;
  stop
endif
if (Fresh observation?\n(tag 0: one per committed scan)) then (no: duplicate,\nlower ID, missing)
  :Continuity does not advance;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
if (Candidate held at or beyond\n`stable_for`?) then (yes)
  :Promote candidate to stable;
else (no)
  :Keep timing the candidate\n(sample time or scan logical time);
endif
:Forward upstream sample lineage;
stop
@enduml
